# Homework 2 - Data Preprocessing and Visualization

This assignment focuses on preparing a real-world customer dataset for later data-mining and machine-learning analysis.

## Objectives
- Inspect and clean the raw customer dataset
- Remove duplicate records
- Correct inconsistent or invalid values
- Handle missing values
- Detect and document outliers
- Standardize selected numerical variables using z-score scaling
- Convert categorical variables using dummy/one-hot encoding
- Summarize major preprocessing results
- Create visualizations to explore the cleaned data
- Review and improve Copilot-generated code for clarity and quality

## Visualizations
- Histogram of total customer spending over the last six months
- Boxplot of annual income
- Bar chart of customers by membership category
- Scatter plot of annual income versus total spending

## Files
- Final cleaned customer dataset
- Standardized numerical dataset
- Encoded categorical dataset
- Preprocessing summary CSV
- Histogram image
- Boxplot image
- Bar chart image
- Scatter plot image
- Markdown documentation of Copilot code improvements
